# Unreal 资源文件按二进制处理
# 避免 Git 做行尾转换，也避免产生无意义的文本 diff / 自动合并
*.uasset  binary
*.umap    binary
*.upk     binary
*.udk     binary
*.udn     binary
*.ubulk   binary
*.uexp    binary

# 图片与音频
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.tga     binary
*.exr     binary
*.hdr     binary
*.wav     binary
*.fbx     binary
*.psd     binary
*.xcf     binary

# 编译产物（正常已被 .gitignore 排除，此处双保险）
*.dll     binary
*.lib     binary
*.exe     binary
*.pdb     binary
